.SH NAME
lean-get - Get the value of a variable


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean get KEY [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Get the value of a variable from the active profile (or a named profile via --profile).

.PP
Examples:
  lean get DEBUG
  lean get API_KEY --profile prod


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for get

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	Target profile (defaults to active)


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlean(1)\fP


